{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25991","headline":"途中旅思二首 二 · 鲍溶","name":"途中旅思二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星出方问宿，睡眼始朦胧。\n天光见地色，上路车幢幢。\n时物既老大，衆山何枯空。\n青冥见古栢，寥朗闻疎鸿。\n独步天地间，无因爲君忠。\n白毛寻人忧，生此头发中。\n跃马非壮岁，报恩无高功。\n斯言化爲火，日夜焚深衷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25991.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25991","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}